  "limits": "Coprime p and q only, since other pairs give links of several loops. The tube can intersect itself when the tube radius is large compared with the gaps between strands; nothing checks or prevents this. Parallel transport is discrete, so very few samples give a visibly faceted tube. Verified in Blender 5.2.1; written for the 4.2 API.",
